%20design.%22%2C%22URL%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fhal.archives-ouvertes.fr%2Ftel-03185876%22%2C%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22family%22%3A%22Hulin%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22Thibaud%22%7D%5D%2C%22accessed%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222022%22%2C3%2C27%5D%5D%7D%2C%22issued%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222020%22%2C12%5D%5D%7D%7D%7D%5D&quot; data-schema-version=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Annotations&lt;br&gt;(01/04/2022 &amp;agrave; 07:29:33)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22S8A6L8MV%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2275%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A77%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B83.137%2C387.604%2C488.127%2C399.559%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C369.677%2C488.123%2C381.632%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C351.75%2C488.125%2C363.705%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C333.822%2C488.13%2C345.777%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C315.895%2C488.123%2C327.85%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C297.968%2C488.129%2C309.923%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C280.041%2C488.121%2C291.996%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C262.113%2C488.129%2C274.068%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C244.186%2C488.12%2C256.141%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C226.259%2C488.13%2C238.214%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C208.332%2C488.12%2C220.287%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C190.404%2C488.12%2C202.359%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C172.477%2C488.12%2C184.432%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C154.55%2C488.13%2C166.505%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C136.623%2C488.126%2C148.578%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C118.695%2C401.468%2C130.65%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2275%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; La th&amp;eacute;orie des supports qui rassemble ici des contributions de B. Bachimont et de J. Fonanille permet d'envisager la mani&amp;egrave;re dont le support in uence l'activit&amp;eacute; d'&amp;eacute;criture et de lecture d'un dispositif technique. Le support est ici pris dans sa quadruple dimension &amp;agrave; savoir : le mat&amp;eacute;riel, le syntaxique, le s&amp;eacute;miotique et l'organisationnel. Ces quatre strates d'analyse incluent des couches interm&amp;eacute;diaires davantage enchev&amp;ecirc;tr&amp;eacute;es qui forment des syst&amp;egrave;mes fonctionnels : la mati&amp;egrave;re, l'&amp;eacute;lectricit&amp;eacute;, un langage informatique, l'appareil perceptif, une organisation sociale, etc. L'exp&amp;eacute;rience interactive peut alors &amp;ecirc;tre analys&amp;eacute;e en e ectuant une d&amp;eacute;marche arch&amp;eacute;ologique, c'est-&amp;agrave;-dire de mise &amp;agrave; jour des &amp;eacute;l&amp;eacute;ments qui composent cette exp&amp;eacute;rience selon leur niveau de granularit&amp;eacute;, c'est-&amp;agrave;-dire selon qu'il se trouve sur l'une de ces quatre strates, ou plus pr&amp;eacute;cis&amp;eacute;ment dans l'une des couches qui compose cette strate. Ainsi, la porosit&amp;eacute; de ces strates fait de l'exp&amp;eacute;rience interactive un syst&amp;egrave;me dynamique en termes de contraintes : les m&amp;eacute;dias num&amp;eacute;riques ne sont pas des &amp;eacute;l&amp;eacute;ments neutres, ils sont au contraire travers&amp;eacute;s par des relations de savoir et de pouvoir qui d&amp;eacute; nissent autant de lignes de contraintes qui orientent l'activit&amp;eacute; humaine instrument&amp;eacute;e sur ces dispositifs de lecture et d'&amp;eacute;criture. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2275%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 75&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22ARDHX8L4%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2281%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A83%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B83.137%2C298.236%2C488.131%2C310.191%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C280.309%2C435.854%2C292.264%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C260.883%2C488.121%2C272.838%5D%2C%5B100.693%2C242.955%2C419.601%2C254.91%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C225.028%2C488.126%2C236.983%5D%2C%5B100.693%2C207.101%2C329.687%2C219.056%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2281%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; Ainsi, l'identit&amp;eacute; comme r&amp;eacute;alit&amp;eacute; sociale est une construction continue faite &amp;agrave; partir d'interactions qui supporte au moins deux points de vue sur l'identit&amp;eacute; : l'identit&amp;eacute; pour autrui, c'est l'identit&amp;eacute; personnelle et l'identit&amp;eacute; sociale d'un individu en r&amp;eacute;ponse au souci qu'ont les autres de nous d&amp;eacute; nir ; l'identit&amp;eacute; pour soi, ce sont les repr&amp;eacute;sentations de soi qui cependant sont construites &amp;agrave; partir de l'identit&amp;eacute; pour autrui. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2281%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 81&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22QRPZVR6L%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2283%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A85%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B146.007%2C605.773%2C318.089%2C617.728%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C587.622%2C488.12%2C599.577%5D%2C%5B100.693%2C569.694%2C126.698%2C581.649%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C551.767%2C419.674%2C563.722%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C533.84%2C488.124%2C545.795%5D%2C%5B100.693%2C515.913%2C160.96%2C527.868%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2283%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; Ainsi F. Georges distingue-t-elle : l'identit&amp;eacute; d&amp;eacute;clarative qui est l'identit&amp;eacute; renseign&amp;eacute;e directement par l'utilisateur ; l'identit&amp;eacute; agissante, renseign&amp;eacute;e indirectement par ses activit&amp;eacute;s ; l'identit&amp;eacute; calcul&amp;eacute;e, produite &amp;agrave; partir du traitement de l'identit&amp;eacute; agissante par un syst&amp;egrave;me. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2283%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 83&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22IFA7P6NK%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2294%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A96%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B190.248%2C225.389%2C523.843%2C237.344%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C207.462%2C517.807%2C219.417%5D%2C%5B118.854%2C188.605%2C445.76%2C200.56%5D%2C%5B118.854%2C170.678%2C496.865%2C182.633%5D%2C%5B118.854%2C152.75%2C398.496%2C164.705%5D%2C%5B118.854%2C134.823%2C389.271%2C146.778%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2294%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; Ainsi, le design de la visibilit&amp;eacute; peut se d&amp;eacute;cliner sous au moins les quatre activit&amp;eacute;s principale suivantes, selon le degr&amp;eacute; de visibilit&amp;eacute; d'une personne : exp&amp;eacute;rimenter de fa&amp;ccedil;on ludique de nouvelles vies et identit&amp;eacute;s ; cacher son identit&amp;eacute; pour mieux d&amp;eacute;sirer se rencontrer dans la vie r&amp;eacute;elle ; outer son identit&amp;eacute; pour mieux l'exp&amp;eacute;rimenter ; se rendre hypervisible pour favoriser sa notori&amp;eacute;t&amp;eacute;. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2294%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 94&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22W38GAYDQ%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%2297%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A99%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B83.137%2C223.529%2C488.125%2C235.484%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C205.602%2C488.129%2C217.557%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C187.675%2C488.124%2C199.63%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C169.748%2C107.193%2C181.703%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2297%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; La r&amp;eacute; exivit&amp;eacute; peut se d&amp;eacute; nir comme la r&amp;eacute; exion spontan&amp;eacute;e se prenant ellem&amp;ecirc;me pour objet et se th&amp;eacute;matisant sur un plan sp&amp;eacute;culatif, scienti que, en &amp;eacute;laborant des crit&amp;egrave;res &amp;eacute;pist&amp;eacute;mologiques d'ordre rationnel , selon le dictionnaire du CNTRL (2010). &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%2297%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 97&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;563&quot; height=&quot;139&quot; data-attachment-key=&quot;6Q6IIVTL&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22PNTRX6LR%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22101%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A103%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B108.575%2C619.547%2C446.575%2C703.102%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22101%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22101%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 101&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22CIMS8VXA%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22107%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A109%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B387.498%2C207.469%2C488.122%2C219.424%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C189.541%2C488.125%2C201.496%5D%2C%5B71.434%2C171.614%2C449.229%2C183.569%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C152.754%2C488.12%2C164.709%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C134.826%2C340.551%2C146.781%5D%2C%5B83.137%2C116.899%2C449.254%2C128.854%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22107%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; Ainsi, la restitution des traces d'activit&amp;eacute; &amp;agrave; l'utilisateur est en mesure de renforcer sa r&amp;eacute; exivit&amp;eacute; &amp;agrave; partir des trois types de r&amp;eacute;tention que nous empruntons &amp;agrave; B. Stiegler (2001) : en activant les supports de m&amp;eacute;moire comme trace &amp;eacute;crite (r&amp;eacute;tention tertiaire), en activant les souvenirs (r&amp;eacute;tention secondaire) en activant la conscience g&amp;eacute;n&amp;eacute;rale de l'individu (r&amp;eacute;tention primaire). &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22107%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 107&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22723CK92X%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22110%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A112%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B118.854%2C683.578%2C523.844%2C695.533%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C665.651%2C523.838%2C677.606%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C647.724%2C523.844%2C659.679%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C629.796%2C523.843%2C641.751%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C611.869%2C523.847%2C623.824%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C593.942%2C523.838%2C605.897%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C576.015%2C523.84%2C587.97%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C558.087%2C523.839%2C570.042%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C540.16%2C523.843%2C552.115%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C522.233%2C523.843%2C534.188%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C504.306%2C523.848%2C516.261%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C486.379%2C523.841%2C498.334%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C468.451%2C523.848%2C480.406%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C450.524%2C470.473%2C462.479%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22110%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; La r&amp;eacute; exivit&amp;eacute; est une propri&amp;eacute;t&amp;eacute; de l'&amp;eacute;criture en g&amp;eacute;n&amp;eacute;ral et de l'&amp;eacute;criture num&amp;eacute;rique en particulier : elle favorise un processus de distanciation et donc potentiellement d'analyse de son v&amp;eacute;cu, en vue de faire des choix de design de notre exp&amp;eacute;rience qui soient coh&amp;eacute;rents. L'exp&amp;eacute;rience xe des sch&amp;egrave;mes, des dispositions, des habitus et produite des traces mn&amp;eacute;siques qui deviennent accessibles &amp;agrave; partir d'un e ort r&amp;eacute; exif. Elle est particuli&amp;egrave;rement n&amp;eacute;cessaire par exemple &amp;agrave; la chercheuse ou au chercheur en sciences humaines et sociales qui est fondamentalement en situation d'observation participante. Cette recherche peut s'appuyer sur l'identi cation de processus cognitifs appropri&amp;eacute;s, via le ph&amp;eacute;nom&amp;egrave;ne de m&amp;eacute;ta-cognition. Malgr&amp;eacute; des limites li&amp;eacute;es par exemple &amp;agrave; l'augmentation de la charge mentale, renforcer les processus cognitifs permet &amp;agrave; l'acteur de mieux designer son exp&amp;eacute;rience : cela est particuli&amp;egrave;rement int&amp;eacute;ressant dans le champ des apprentissages o&amp;ugrave; il est n&amp;eacute;cessaire de r&amp;eacute;viser une strat&amp;eacute;gie. L'&amp;eacute;tude de ces processus peut &amp;ecirc;tre transpos&amp;eacute;e au niveau collectif qui peut aussi &amp;ecirc;tre consid&amp;eacute;r&amp;eacute;e comme un actant &amp;agrave; part enti&amp;egrave;re. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22110%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 110&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22Q93E4HWN%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22120%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A122%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B118.854%2C387.604%2C523.84%2C399.559%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C369.677%2C523.844%2C381.632%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C351.75%2C523.838%2C363.705%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C333.822%2C523.842%2C345.777%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C315.895%2C523.839%2C327.85%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C297.968%2C523.847%2C309.923%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C280.041%2C366.317%2C291.996%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22120%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; La mise &amp;agrave; distanciation du monde et de soi par l'&amp;eacute;criture est &amp;agrave; l'origine du d&amp;eacute;veloppement de la pens&amp;eacute;e critique. Ainsi l'&amp;eacute;criture num&amp;eacute;rique, malgr&amp;eacute; son apparente imm&amp;eacute;diatet&amp;eacute;, est-elle susceptible de favoriser le d&amp;eacute;veloppement de la pens&amp;eacute;e critique en lien avec la raison computationnelle. Pour cela, certaines conditions doivent &amp;ecirc;tre rassembl&amp;eacute;es, en favorisant l'analyse des conditions d'&amp;eacute;nonciation des m&amp;eacute;dias num&amp;eacute;riques, en articulant &amp;agrave; c&amp;ocirc;t&amp;eacute; d'une approche proc&amp;eacute;durale une approche r&amp;eacute; exive donc critique, comparative et strat&amp;eacute;gique. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22120%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 120&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;744&quot; height=&quot;598&quot; data-attachment-key=&quot;RFQJVWLG&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22LTTT7U7B%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22135%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A137%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B58.064%2C382.097%2C504.639%2C740.868%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22135%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22135%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 135&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
