&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;567&quot; height=&quot;366&quot; data-attachment-key=&quot;AI5IMJDP&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22M7NNIX33%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22164%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A166%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B145.714%2C457.247%2C485.893%2C676.89%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22164%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22164%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 164&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;737&quot; height=&quot;322&quot; data-attachment-key=&quot;FUNBPGYG&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22T3SQ2QKW%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22168%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A170%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B93.214%2C441.176%2C535.179%2C634.569%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22168%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22168%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 168&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;highlight&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%223DD3Q9RI%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22234%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A236%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B107.151%2C351.75%2C523.845%2C363.705%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C333.822%2C523.845%2C345.777%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C315.895%2C523.838%2C327.85%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C297.968%2C523.846%2C309.923%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C280.041%2C523.843%2C291.996%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C262.113%2C523.841%2C274.068%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C244.186%2C523.844%2C256.141%5D%2C%5B107.151%2C226.259%2C413.651%2C238.214%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22234%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&amp;laquo; L'analyse de l'exp&amp;eacute;rience que nous avons r&amp;eacute;alis&amp;eacute;e avec cet outil en situation montre l'int&amp;eacute;r&amp;ecirc;t d'un syst&amp;egrave;me de base de traces d'activit&amp;eacute; pour la recherche d'information et le renforcement de la r&amp;eacute; exivit&amp;eacute; dans un but p&amp;eacute;dagogique. Outre les perspectives d'am&amp;eacute;lioration possibles au niveau de la satisfaction de l'exp&amp;eacute;rience utilisateur, les limites concernent la possibilit&amp;eacute; pour l'utilisateur d'oublier des t&amp;acirc;ches non m&amp;eacute;di&amp;eacute;es comme la r&amp;eacute; exion sur la probl&amp;eacute;matique de la recherche. Cette approche nous para&amp;icirc;t pertinente pour d&amp;eacute;velopper l'autonomie, la pens&amp;eacute;e critique et la ma&amp;icirc;trise de soi du chercheur d'information en situation d'apprentissage. &amp;raquo;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22234%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 234&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;771&quot; height=&quot;772&quot; data-attachment-key=&quot;2VQVP6CD&quot; data-annotation=&quot;%7B%22attachmentURI%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F7VJM4EWC%22%2C%22annotationKey%22%3A%22KKPKHUZI%22%2C%22color%22%3A%22%23ffd400%22%2C%22pageLabel%22%3A%22242%22%2C%22position%22%3A%7B%22pageIndex%22%3A244%2C%22rects%22%3A%5B%5B78.75%2C248.319%2C541.071%2C711.176%5D%5D%7D%2C%22citationItem%22%3A%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22242%22%7D%7D&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F13594%2Fitems%2F8IQAB673%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%22242%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Hulin, 2020, p. 242&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
