    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_2486">
        <rdf:value>&lt;p&gt;&quot;If there are no question, there are no answers. If there are questions, then, of course, there are answers, but the final answer makes the questions seem absurd, whereas the questions, up until then, seem more intelligent than the answers.&quot; p. 118&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:value>
