        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2012-10-11 10:00:28</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
        <dc:description>The author offers an exercise of reflexivity concerning ten years of researchs dedicated to the committing and instituante environmental communication. She puts in perspective the originality of these researchs dedicated to relation between communication and action by underlining their heuristic reach.</dc:description>
        <bib:pages>171-184</bib:pages>
