        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_3472"/>
        <dc:title>SOBOLEO – Social Bookmarking and Lighweight Engineering of Ontologies</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>We present SOBOLEO, a system for the webbased collaborative engineering of SKOS ontologies and annotation of web resources. SOBOLEO enables the simple creation, extension and maintenance of taxonomies. At the same time, it supports the annotation of web resources with concepts from this taxonomy.</dcterms:abstract>
        <z:libraryCatalog>Zotero</z:libraryCatalog>
