        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_3481"/>
        <dc:title>Combining the CIDOC CRM and MPEG-7 to Describe Multimedia in Museums</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>This paper describes a proposal for an interoperable metadata model, based on international standards, which has been designed to enable the description, exchange and sharing of multimedia resources both within and between cultural institutions.</dcterms:abstract>
